\b 1) What the app does\b0\par
\par
Beds4Crew is a marketplace app for crew and travel accommodation workflows. Users can:\par
- browse available stays\par
- create an account and manage a profile\par
- request/book accommodations\par
- message around reservation activity\par
- manage support/help resources\par
- optionally subscribe to host plans to unlock property listing capacity and host tools\par
\par
